+Fix I would make: use `SafeERC20` for the pool approval too, specifically `forceApprove` or an equivalent low-level optional-return-safe approval flow that also handles USDT's zero-first allowance rule. Then keep this pinned fork test in CI so the real USDT/Aave integration is continuously exercised.
