+## Sign-off
+
+This is not safe to deploy Monday as-is. The current implementation cannot complete a real mainnet USDT deposit, silently loses accounting for retained withdrawal fees, and allows an owner-settable fee to brick deposits. The fixes should be applied first, then covered by:
+
+- pinned mainnet fork tests for USDT/Aave deposit and withdraw,
+- handler-driven invariants tying `totalAssets`, shares, user balances, and actual aUSDT custody together,
+- fuzz tests for every fee boundary in both constructor and setter.
